## AI Assistance

Kali GPT and ShellGPT were used during the lab to help translate plain-English goals into commands and assist with troubleshooting.

The AI-generated commands still required review before execution. In some cases, the suggested flags or syntax did not fully match the environment. One of the most important lessons was that using AI effectively still requires enough technical understanding to verify whether its output is correct, safe, and relevant.
